# edge-base.script — task-46 edge-flow BASELINE schedule (no disturbances).
#
# The input/capture schedule that edge-flows.script disturbs with
# leave/enter (focus loss/gain) pairs. Both scripts share every keydown/
# keyup/capture target verbatim; the state-hash streams must be IDENTICAL
# (simulation never sees focus events) and same-named captures must be
# pixel-identical on the same backend.
#
# Screens exercised (Q9 set, full): initial help, redrawn help ('h' from
# title), shipyard+play start, engagement checkpoints, 'n' reset ->
# hi-score table -> restart, coast to natural game-over table, quit.
#
# Run (frame handshake so XAST_STATE_HASH_FILE is exported):
#   ./obj/harness --seed 12345 --script test/harness/scripts/edge-base.script \
#       --out DIR --handshake frame --keep \
#       --hiscore test/harness/fixtures/hiScore.nul.data

1    capture help0          # initial screen IS the help screen (task-7 fact)

3    keydown h              # title 'h': redraw help
6    keyup h
20   capture help_redrawn

30   keydown s              # start game
34   keyup s
60   capture start

# --- engagement 1: rotate left, thrust, two shots
70   keydown e
74   keyup e
80   keydown o
94   keyup o
100  keydown p
104  keyup p
115  keydown p
119  keyup p
140  capture gp1

# --- 'n' reset-and-return path -> hi-score table (Q9 score screen)
150  keydown n
154  keyup n
190  capture hiscore_n

200  keydown s              # restart from the table
204  keyup s
240  capture start2

# --- engagement 2: rotate right, thrust, shot, hyperspace
250  keydown r
254  keyup r
260  keydown o
274  keyup o
280  keydown p
284  keyup p
320  capture gp2
330  keydown space
334  keyup space
360  capture gp3

# --- engagement 3: thrust burst
370  keydown o
388  keyup o
400  capture gp4

# --- coast: idle ship dies to seeded rocks/saucers (cf. gameover.script:
#     last life lost ~1100 boundaries after start; start happened at b200)
1700 capture hiscore_death  # natural end-of-game hi-score table

1720 keydown q              # quit from the table -> clean exit
1724 keyup q
exit
